WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
From a phone call to a confirmed appointment.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The AI receptionist collects the request and connects to the booking workflow.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
It checks Google Calendar and offers available times for the caller to choose.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
The workflow validates the details, checks the slot again, and creates the booking.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Email alerts notify the team. Call details are recorded for follow-up.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Connected calls. Organized appointments.
